        "acc_why": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHY IT WORKS",
            "content": "<p>Engineered for everyday garage use, our premium interlocking tiles create a durable, professional-looking floor that handles vehicles, tools, spills, and heavy use. The open-grid design allows airflow and drainage while the interlocking system keeps your floor securely in place.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_how": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "EASY TO INSTALL",
            "content": "<p>No glue, coatings, or professional installer required. Start on a clean, level surface and simply snap the tiles together row by row. Trim tiles where needed along walls and finish the garage entrance with the included tapered edge pieces. Most garages can be transformed in just a few hours.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_specs": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "SPECIFICATIONS",
            "content": "<p>Your GridGarage kit is custom calculated for your space and includes the interlocking floor tiles needed for your selected size, pattern, and colors, plus matching front entrance edge pieces. Tile dimensions, construction, 45,000 weight capacity, warranty, and available colors vary by the collection selected.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_shipping": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "SHIPPING & RETURNS",
            "content": "<p>Free nationwide shipping is included with qualifying GridGarage kits. Most orders ship within 2–6 business days. Every kit is backed by our 30-day money-back guarantee. See our Shipping & Returns Policy for complete details. All tiles have a 20 year warranty.</p>"
          }
        }
